<header class="hero" id="top" data-theme="dark">
  <canvas id="grid" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <canvas id="field" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="spot" id="spot"></div>
  <div class="vign"></div>
  <span class="side l">ENJOY LIFE, ONE STEP UP</span>
  <span class="side r">SCROLL TO EXPLORE →</span>
  <div class="window pre" id="win">
    <div class="window-bar">
      <span class="dot" style="background:#B4553F"></span><span class="dot" style="background:#C79038"></span><span class="dot" style="background:#5F9B6E"></span>
      <span class="t">ara@joifup: ~</span>
    </div>
    <div class="screen" id="screen">
      <div class="ln"><span class="p">ara@joifup</span>:<span class="hl">~</span>$ <span class="cmd">whoami</span></div>
      <div class="ln out">ara — engineer / AI</div>
      <div class="ln"><span class="p">ara@joifup</span>:<span class="hl">~</span>$ <span class="cmd">echo $MOTTO</span></div>
      <div class="ln out motto lit">En<b>jo</b>y L<b>if</b>e, One Step <b>Up</b>.</div>
      <div class="ln out eq"><span class="part">jo</span> + <span class="part">if</span> + <span class="part">up</span> = <span class="name">joifup</span></div>
      <h1 class="ln" id="headline"><span class="big">人生を楽しみ、<em>一歩上へ</em>。</span></h1>
      <div class="ln"><span class="p">ara@joifup</span>:<span class="hl">~</span>$ <span class="cmd">ls</span></div>
      <div class="ln out"><span class="hl">work/</span>    事務作業を仕組みで減らす事業
<span class="hl">joifup/</span>  自分で毎日使っている記録のアプリ
<span class="hl">blog/</span>    Notion で書いて静的に配信するブログ
<span class="hl">writing/</span> ブログ・X・Zenn での発信</div>
      <div class="ln"><span class="p">ara@joifup</span>:<span class="hl">~</span>$ <span class="caret"></span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="scroll-hint">SCROLL<i></i></div>
</header>
